  "content": "\n\n<p><span><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/vE3eal-TyMY?wmode=transparent\" width=\"638\" height=\"358\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span>需要 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/creativecore\" rel=\"nofollow\">CreativeCore</a></span></p>\n<p><span>有没有试过在硬核模组中游玩？你可能在几秒钟内就会死亡。一步走错便是终结。这可能会让人感到非常沮丧，尤其是当你和朋友一起玩的时候。你可能想要挑战高难度，但不想这么残酷吧？PlayerRevive 是一个很好的折中方案。它允许玩家在死亡后 60 秒内被复活。一个愚蠢的错误不应该是你的终点。现在，这取决于你的朋友了。</span></p>\n<p>建议安装 <a href=\"https://minecraft.curseforge.com/projects/enhancedvisuals\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">EnhancedVisuals</a> 以获得更史诗、更刺激的体验。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">正在寻找和朋友一起玩的服务端？我们的赞助商为您提供支持：</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">[![](<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.bisecthosting.com%252fimages%252flogos%252fdark_text%25401538x500.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/logos/dark_text@1538x500.png</a>)](<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fteamcreative\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://bisecthosting.com/teamcreative</a>)</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">使用优惠码 **teamcreative**，购买任意游戏服务器首月即可享受 25% 的折扣！</p>\n<p><strong>不兼容说明</strong></p>\n<p>1.12：PotionCore：请确保将“切换维度时修复效果”（Fix Effects When Changing Dimensions）设置为 false。</p>\n<p><strong>附加组件</strong></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/tacz-sbw-playerrevive-gun-mod-compitability\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">[TaCZ/SBW] PlayerRevive 枪械模组兼容性</a></p>\n<p><strong>音乐</strong></p>\n<p>Zander Noriega - Perpetual Tension <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fopengameart.org%252fcontent%252fperpetual-tension\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://opengameart.org/content/perpetual-tension</a><br>\nDream Raid - Matthew Pablo <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fopengameart.org%252fcontent%252fdream-raid-cinematic-action-soundtrack\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://opengameart.org/content/dream-raid-cinematic-action-soundtrack</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/creativemd\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/g2vJewK.png\" alt=\"\"></a>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://minecraft.curseforge.com/linkout?remoteUrl=https://discord.gg/W9QM3fS\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/YF5WrZ1.png\" alt=\"\"></a></p>",
